			Alc.
			32
		</span></i> and as v.l. in
		<i><span class="en">
			Il.
			1.117
		</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
			A.D.
			<u>Conj.</u>
			223.10
		</span></i>; but 
			Comp.
		
